{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an early demo for Fairysite - a tactical turn-based game.  <br> <br>You manage a colony of fairies. In this demo, your goal is to find a magical portal, open it and get away before the human expansion overwhelms you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and the humans have complicated relationships. As a parasite, you dependent on their resources. However, they can expand fast and overrun your structures. You must play the balance between restricting the humans and letting them go loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You win a level when you locate a portal and open it. You lose if all your Groves are lost.<br><br>The demo contains five levels with increasing difficulty.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549680?t=1743157876","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549680?t=1743157876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549680/fe78c42b0a69e37609920d2a0dee664106e8569c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743157876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549680/fe78c42b0a69e37609920d2a0dee664106e8569c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743157876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game itself is not about adult content, but some of the flavor text hints them (including horror, erotica and alcohol)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an early demo for Fairysite - a tactical turn-based game.  <br> <br>You manage a colony of fairies. In this demo, your goal is to find a magical portal, open it and get away before the human expansion overwhelms you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and the humans have complicated relationships. As a parasite, you dependent on their resources. However, they can expand fast and overrun your structures. 